    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hiseadayda nalaat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwahidu malaykajeanjagi bea jeedeaba giika asispwa mideawa gweeraji ispwaan ak gwayeeshiinean, “Beeni, gaydaahiimneey girgweaksiinda hiseadayda haw abiita badayda beega saang'aan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea nihiseada sea sugoodiga badayda ng'eanyiida, ak gea mida badayda ng'eanyiida ea niboogit aba difaayeeda hiseadayeanduumeadaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwaadan aba jeeda Guroorooda ea dawa dareapcheeda, ak ghaadaayi gatmooda nea goopteada aba badayda diyeayda areara nea ghwanyiit saseeda gheawunga giing'weaka, nea gwandeawa iheeni ispwa ea gujaw damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gatmoodida ea niikwa hang'da oomu ea dea areara, nea siitaamdaamwa dahaabu ea gea haw sheayeat ea sageeka, ak gwanda geatindaanyi gikoombeeyda mida dahaabu biissa ghwanyiit ng'asheega munyas ea ririnnyeanda hiseadayeanduumeadaanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gheamamdaanyi geeng'oorsa gheawunga makcheameeda, “Babeleeda haw, gheamata fuga hiseada bea ng'asheega munyas bea ng'eanyiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaadaayi gatmoodida, nea niboogit aba foojeanda fuga ghaydidi sea foojeanda sinuus aba badayda Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghaadaayi gatmoodida ghahamwan ng'eanyi gidahaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeeshiinean malaykajeanda, “Ghwasaan anda gihami ng'eanyi? Gaydarukuneey makcheameedeaba gatmooni, ea dea diyeayda mideawa iheeni ispwa ea gujaw damanamughuush aat gatmooniin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diyeaydideani idaahiin abeeda gwanda, ak ea mandana, ak gaygwadiyeana uuta shoomanda mamuudeana ak gawa heeda ng'asheega munyas. Ak fuga mida badayda ng'eanyiida miyeeng'oorsa gheawunga nyaawa jeeda gitaabooda eaweega dea sibada sindeeta ng'eanyiida, gayghahamng'eanyi iidaah diyeaydida. Aba gideaba gwanda, ak ea mandana ak gayghwahidu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak nih geeguura heeda fughareeda mida weaghuumeeda: iheengiga as ispwaan giijeega as ispwa apteadawa gatmooni gil; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwanda eara sugoodi ispwa, nea muut aba jeenyaawa ea niibeada, akaleala gwanda, ak niirja ea miighwahidu, nea iihidu gayghwashng'u gilinuwaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea diyeaydida mida ak ea mandanean, niny deaba sissi ak niny gaba jeedeaba giika asispwaan, ak niny gawa jeeda ng'asheega munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gujakiga atamanamughuush idaahiin ea sugoodiga atamanamughuush gil, was gea miighoang'waay uurda sugoocheanduumeeda, ak ea ninyas gheambalmeeda gawuurji sugoodiga aba aseadeanagi, sea diyeayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saawa gaba fughareanagi ak saawa ghoadaw diyeaydida uurda nyaawa ea gheambalmeeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak suh gaygang'uchi sea Dayeenda Gisilleanda, ak gayghwajoar Dayeenda Gisilleanda saawa, aba gideaba niny Ng'utamiida ng'utamoojiga gil ea Sugoocheanda sugoodiga, ak suh mideawa ninyiin ea gea geeguursa gea siloat ea gea doobiiweadi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeeshiinean, “Beegigeani idaahiin, bea heeda apteadawa hiseadaydideaniin, ada buuneeda gil ea eemoojiga ea iidiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gujakiga atamanamughuush idaahiin, ea diyeaydida ak gayghwasit hiseadaydida ak gajeenung' ghang'ut salgheang'da nea dawiish, ak gajeayaak banyeagaaschi ak gajeenung' gamurjan aba beasta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba ASEETA niyiin gurooruunatka nyaawa ak ghwasareanda gidagasiida nea gaba fughareanagi ak ghoadaw diyeaydida uurda sugoocheanduumeeda nyaawa, ea gwasa ng'asheega ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gatmoodida idaahiin ea mujiineedida hawiin gil mideawa giimbaliischooda aba badayda sugoodiga badayda ng'eanyiidean.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
